						 <div style="display:none"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" name="typeFrame"></iframe></div> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/memoria-adytum/memoriabanner.jpg" alt="memoriabanner.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000;font-size: 450%;"><strong>追忆，内殿</strong></span></div> <div class="type1"> <p><sup>5</sup>……亚恩站在燃烧的废墟中，这片废墟曾是通往基西拉之城的大门。再一次伪装成一个人类，在以他的名义造成的灾难面前屈卑。他环顾四周，看到了那些他曾经希望获得自由的人们所遭受的痛苦，意识到他们的伟大杰作是经由他的手埋没。<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> 他看着他们，泪流不止。<br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="font-family:var(--body-font); font-size: calc(var(--base-font-size) * 1.00); color: #000000;">- <em>堕落之书，13:5；所罗门尼派</em>《Valkzaron》</span></p> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">╡<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sarkicism-hub">欲肉教中心页</a>╞</span></p> </div> <h3><span>前言：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%"><em>太初有道</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[&#32;|&#32;|&#32;|&#32;|&#32;]</span></span></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2095">SCP-2095：伊亚罗斯之围</a> <em>by Metaphysician</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2480">SCP-2480：未完的仪式</a> <em>by Metaphysician</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/mother-who-demands-ones-toes">术士Halyna Ieva，又称索取他人脚趾的母亲</a> <em>by naepicfael &amp; TheMightyMcB</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lovataar-throne">拉娃塔与御座</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <hr /> <h3><span>第一部分：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%"><em>苍马入目</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">█</span> | | | <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <h5><span><em>正典</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">主线</span></span></h5> <ul> <li>瘟疫 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3862">SCP-3862: The Gentleman Karcist</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li>战争 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/another-soul-joins-the-halkost">Another Soul Joins the Halkost</a> <em>by TheMightyMcB</em></li> <li>饥荒 - <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4786">SCP-4786：饥饿之口</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li>死亡 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/anthropological-report-darkwater">Case Study 03: The Darkwater Lodge</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/et-ecce">Et Ecce Equus Pallidus</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>辅助</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">补充故事</span></span></h5> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4476">SCP-4476: La Famille Natau</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2408">SCP-2408：欧若科之陨</a> <em>by Metaphysician</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4197">SCP-4197: Hollow</a> <em>by Dyslexion</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/lance-and-bernard-s-culinary-capers">Lance and Bernard's Culinary Capers</a> <em>by Dyslexion</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/mornings-mornings-are-sometimes-like-that">mornings Mornings Are Sometimes Like That</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>终末</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">最后一幕</span></span></h5> <ul> <li>此世皇帝 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3911">SCP-3911: The Thorn of God</a> <em>by MalyceGraves</em></li> </ul> <hr /> <h3><span>第二部分：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%;"><em>他们凯旋</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">██</span> | | <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <h5><span><em>正典</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">主线</span></span></h5> <ul> <li>瘟疫 - <a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5862">SCP-5862: Faulkner's Wake</a> <em>by MalyceGraves &amp; cybersqyd</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>辅助</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">补充故事</span></span></h5> <ul> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5207">SCP-5207: Fit for the King</a> <em>by MalyceGraves &amp; DrAkimoto</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5407">SCP-5407: &quot;нектар&quot;</a> <em>by DrAkimoto</em></li> <li><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/regarding-scp-5862">Re: 5862 (Supplemental)</a> <em>by MalyceGraves &amp; cybersqyd</em></li> </ul> <h5><span><em>终末</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">最后一幕</span></span></h5> <hr /> <h3><span>第三部分：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%;"><em>征服世界</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">███</span> | <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <h5><span><em>正典</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">主线</span></span></h5> <h5><span><em>辅助</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">补充故事</span></span></h5> <h5><span><em>终末</em> - <span style="font-size:75%;">最后一幕</span></span></h5> <hr /> <h3><span>第四部分：<span style="font-family: 'Long Cang', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 120%;"><em>焚世净火</em></span></span></h3> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">基金会威胁意识：<span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">[</span><span style="color: #390000">█████</span><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">]</span></span></p> <hr /> <div class="authors"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"